  dcterms:description "Heart rate, respiratory rate and SpO₂ charted in the first four hours of 133 ICU stays (94 patients, 121 hospital admissions; 2,501 observations), with care-unit intervals and the first-ranked billed diagnosis, extracted from MIMIC-IV Clinical Database Demo v2.2. Available as the original PhysioNet release, as five linked CSV tables, and as FHIR R4-aligned RDF.";
